# Cream & Batter Bakery Website

Live site: https://carolopokuboaten-arch.github.io/Web-POE/

A responsive bakery website for Cream & Batter in Raceway Park, Bloemfontein, built with HTML, CSS and JavaScript only.

## Pages
- **index.html** (Home): product galleries, search, sort, image zoom, "today's special" button
- **menu.html**: full menu with prices, photo gallery with zoom, shopping cart
- **about.html**: about the bakery
- **contact.html**: contact form, Google Map, address, email, phone, social media buttons
- **enquiry.html**: opening-hours accordion, enquiry form with cost and availability response, cart summary

## Features
- **Search and sort (Home):** live search by product name, sort by price (low to high, high to low) and name (A-Z)
- **Image zoom:** clicking a picture opens a larger view. Click outside or press Esc to close
- **Welcome box:** a button that swaps the message to today's special and back
- **Shopping cart (Menu):** Add to cart buttons, quantity + and - controls, running total, cart saved with localStorage
- **Checkout:** the cart appears on the Enquiry page and is sent with the enquiry
- **Accordion (Enquiry):** expandable sections for opening hours and custom orders
- **Google Map:** embedded map of the bakery on the Contact page
- **Social media buttons:** Instagram, Threads and TikTok links that open in a new tab
- **Responsive design:** layouts adapt to desktop, tablet and phone

## Forms and JavaScript validation
**Enquiry form**
- Fields: name, email, phone, product (grouped by cookies, pastries, cupcakes, cakes), quantity, date
- Checks: name length, email format, 10-digit phone starting with 0, quantity 1 to 100, date not in the past
- Red error messages under each wrong field, plus an error box
- On success: thank-you message with estimated cost and availability (cakes need 3 days' notice, large orders 2 days)
- Submitted asynchronously with AJAX (fetch) for a smoother experience

**Contact form**
- Fields: name, email, phone, type of message, message
- Checks: name length, email format, phone format, message type chosen, message at least 10 characters
- On success: thank-you message and a compiled email preview with a Send Email button that opens the user's email app addressed to the bakery

## SEO
- Unique title tag and meta description on every page
- One h1 per page, with h2/h3 headings for structure
- Descriptive alt text on images
- Clean URL structure: lowercase file names, hyphens instead of spaces, short flat structure, index.html as the home page
- Internal linking through the navigation on every page
- Canonical links on each page
- Mobile-friendly viewport and responsive layout
- **Local SEO:** Bloemfontein used in titles and descriptions, full address and phone on the Contact page, Google Map embedded
- **robots.txt** and **sitemap.xml** created and linked to the live site

## Page speed
- Images given width and height attributes
- loading="lazy" on images below the first screen
- Scripts placed at the bottom of the page
- Unused code removed (old Leaflet map code)
- Images compressed

## Security
- HTTPS provided by GitHub Pages (Enforce HTTPS ticked)
- External links use rel="noopener noreferrer"
- User input shown with textContent, not innerHTML
- All form input validated in JavaScript before use
- No passwords or private keys in the code

## Promotion
- Website link added to the Instagram, TikTok and Threads profiles
- Posts with hashtags (#Bloemfontein #bakery #cupcakes) linking to the site
- Link shared with friends and family on WhatsApp
- Social buttons on the website link back to the profiles

